window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: It's Just a Flop, So Why Is the Whole Internet Begging to Be My Apprentice","paragraphs":["Content warnings:","Brain-checking station (✿╹◡╹)","1. The online and real-life portions are portrayed in a 1:1 ratio.","2. The amounts of money get pretty outrageous later on.","3. All the male leads are completely clean.","4. Every platform has different burner accounts, and there are lots of aliases.","5. Every type of livestreaming will make an appearance, though voice-chat rooms will get the most attention.","6. The heroine has multiple men on the go at once. Now that she has a tycoon system, sticking to a one-on-one relationship would be a waste of such a cheat.","The light from the phone screen flickered across Gu Lan’s face.","Her private messages and comment section on Douyin had been completely overrun.","Half the comments came from indignant self-appointed justice warriors, condemning her for playing with people’s feelings and calling her nothing short of a shameless heartbreaker.","The other half... had taken a rather strange turn.","[Girl, I don’t care how you managed to date two guys at once. I just want to know how you got two streamers completely obsessed with you without spending a single cent.]","[I spent over eighty thousand yuan on my favorite streamer and couldn’t even get a private-message friend slot. Can you teach me how to freeload like you? I’ll pay!]","[Please, I want a tutorial too! I feel like I’ve been watching livestreams wrong all this time—and wasting my money. So this is what high-level gameplay looks like?]","[I spent hundreds of thousands and didn’t even get to hold his hand! What does that make me?]","[It makes you rich.]","Expressionless, Gu Lan scrolled through the screen. Her fingertip lightly tapped the comments asking for a tutorial before she quickly swiped past them.","Both streamers had blocked her.","One was a singer, the other a dancer.","One had a gorgeous face, the other an incredible voice.","She had spent an entire summer painstakingly winning them over, wheedling and coaxing until she finally got them interested. Then, because of an unexpected cross-room PK battle, all her hard work had gone up in smoke.","How heartbreaking.","Gu Lan pursed her lips. The unhappiness in her heart was less heartbreak than the fury of having a carefully cultivated game save suddenly deleted.","As for the people cursing her, she filtered them out automatically. The ones begging for a tutorial, however, gave her a strange sense of smug satisfaction.","They wanted to learn?","This wasn’t something anyone could master just by studying. Talent was required.","She couldn’t stay on this platform anymore—or at least not for a while.","Gu Lan sighed and dug through a pile of flashy game apps until she found a plain-looking one: Oxygen Voice.","She had downloaded it ages ago but never used it once.","She might as well use this little no-name platform as a temporary refuge.","Once the app finished downloading and updating, she began registering a new account with practiced ease.","Username: Food Liu You.","Profile picture: an abstract, crookedly drawn picture of Lazy Goat that looked both depressed and obnoxious.","Done.","The moment she tapped “Complete,” an electronic voice that clearly did not come from her phone’s speakers exploded inside her head.","[Ding—]","[Host detected exhibiting stingy heartbreaker behavior. Qualification for binding confirmed.]","Gu Lan’s hand froze around her phone.","Was she hallucinating? Had staying up too late finally fried her brain?","[Online Tycoon System 3.0—Simp Edition—activating...]","[Activation successful!]","The voice rang out again, crystal clear this time, with a barely suppressed excitement, like a chatterbox who had finally found someone to unload on.","[Hello, Host! I’m your personal System 3.0. You can call me San-chan! In light of your previous “only take, never give” behavior, this system will help you turn over a new leaf and become the most popular big-spending queen on the internet!]","Gu Lan: “...”","What the hell?","“Only take, never give”?","Was this thing calling her stingy?","Before she could even finish complaining internally, the chatty system spilled out all the rules like beans from a broken pod.","[The rules are very simple! Whenever you spend money online on a male with a score of eighty or above in looks, you’ll receive a one-to-one cash rebate!]","[Spend money on an absolutely gorgeous man with a looks score of ninety or above, and you’ll receive a one-to-ten cash rebate!]","[The looks score will be automatically determined by the system’s backend. Fair and impartial! Host, forget the penny-pinching version of yourself and embark on your path to becoming a tycoon!]","Spend money?","On men?","Gu Lan’s first reaction was resistance. What kind of joke was this? Her motto in life was, “Freeloading is king.”","Asking her to spend money was practically the same as asking her to die.","But...","A one-to-ten rebate?","That number circled through her mind, and its meaning instantly changed.","If she sent a super-handsome guy ten thousand yuan in gifts, the system would give her one hundred thousand in return? She’d make a net profit of ninety thousand?","This... wasn’t spending money at all. It was making money!","And it was the ultimate way to get rich by turning nothing into something!","Gu Lan’s thoughts began to race.","She could use someone else’s money to pursue the handsome men she wanted, and in the end, the money would still end up in her own pocket.","Was there anything more wonderful in the world?","“Not bad,” she murmured, tentatively acknowledging the pie that had fallen from the sky.","[Host, would you like to accept the binding? Countdown: ten, nine...]","“Accept.” Gu Lan didn’t hesitate.","Anyone who refused free money was an idiot.","[Binding successful! Best wishes on your spending spree, Host. May you become a wealthy woman soon!]","The system’s voice cheerfully faded away.","Gu Lan turned her attention back to the phone screen.","The Oxygen Voice app’s homepage was extremely simple. Row after row of rooms filled the screen, divided into all sorts of categories.","[Songs on Request], [Voice Acting], [Emotional Radio], [Voice Chat & Dating].","It was an entirely different world from the Douyin she had used before.","Most of the streamers here never showed their faces. Their cover images were either anime-style handsome men, scenic views, or abstract avatars like hers.","How was she supposed to find men with looks scores of eighty or ninety?","Was this system deliberately making things difficult for her?","There was no way she could throw money at an anime avatar without knowing who was behind it. What if the person on the other side turned out to be a hairy middle-aged man? Who would she even complain to then?","Irritably scratching at her hair, Gu Lan decided to start with the most popular room.","She entered a room tagged [Goodnight Melodies], where the number of viewers was displayed as 99+.","The moment she entered, a noisy wave of excitement slammed into her.","A young man was belting out a popular love song over the public mic. Not only was he singing wildly off-key—somewhere around Siberia—he also seemed completely convinced that he sounded amazing. Every note dragged on forever.","A crowd of young girls flooded the public chat with messages like “You’re amazing, big brother!” and “Your singing is so beautiful!” The free flower gifts flashed across the screen almost nonstop.","Gu Lan’s ears suffered severe occupational damage.","This was the platform’s most popular room?","Her opinion of the platform’s average quality plummeted instantly.","With a voice like that, he would have been hunted down by the entire voice-lover community she belonged to.","Just as she was preparing to pinch her nose and leave the room, a clear yet slightly lazy male voice came through the public mic.","The voice wasn’t particularly loud or soft, but it seemed to carry a magnetic hook. It pierced through the surrounding noise and slipped precisely into her ears.","“All right, thank you to Mic One for that deeply heartfelt performance. It was very... spirited.”","He paused, as though carefully choosing his words. In the end, he settled on “spirited,” a trace of laughter concealed in the lingering note of his voice.","“Next up—friend on mic two, are you there?”","Gu Lan’s finger, poised to click the exit button, froze in midair.","Her entire body went still.","That voice...","It was incredible.","It was practically tailor-made to hit every one of her voice-crush sweet spots.","The TikTok disaster, the infuriating comments, and that money-draining system—all of it was instantly banished to the farthest reaches of her mind.","There was only one thought left in her head.","He had to be mine."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: The plot of looking down on level 0 low-level accounts, though late, still arrives","paragraphs":["Gu Lan stood frozen in place as though someone had cast a petrification spell on her. Even her breathing instinctively grew lighter.","That clear, mellow male voice didn’t speak again. Another person took over the public mic and began singing another sugary little love song of unknown origin.","But Gu Lan’s ears had already blocked out every other sound automatically.","Her mind kept replaying that one sentence from moments ago:","“Very... spirited.”","The slight pause, the lazy smile hidden in the lilt of his voice—every tiny detail landed precisely on all her weak spots, teasing an itch in her heart.","She silently lingered in the room like a leopard hiding in the grass, patiently waiting for its prey.","She wasn’t in a hurry.","The more exceptional the prey, the more patience it required.","Minute after minute passed. The songs on the public mic changed one after another, and Gu Lan’s patience was nearly worn away by all the screeching and howling.","Just as she was about to visit another room, a private-message notification popped up at the top of her phone.","It was a message from the Oxygen app.","She opened it and saw that it had been sent by someone with the ID “Wn.Qing.”","[Wn.Qing: Sis, would you like to hear a song? I can sing pop songs, and I’m not too bad.]","Gu Lan raised an eyebrow.","That opening line... was far too plain.","It sounded exactly like something a rookie would say—he didn’t even know how to come up with a decent sales pitch. Back when she used Douyin, streamers went all-out trying to attract attention. Their copywriting had become so elaborate it was practically an art form.","“A newcomer?” she wondered.","Still, someone taking the initiative was better than no one at all.","Gu Lan’s thoughts shifted, and she called for the system in her head.","“San-chan, get out here and do some work. Check the looks of this ‘Wn.Qing’ and that host from earlier, ‘Wn.Xu.’”","[Ding! Appearance assessment in progress...]","[Wn.Qing, appearance score: 81. The host may receive a 1:1 rebate on the user’s spending.]","[Wn.Xu, appearance score: 90. The host may receive a 1:10 rebate on the user’s spending.]","Ninety points! A tenfold rebate!","Gu Lan’s heart gave a sharp thump.","Her ears hadn’t deceived her after all! Someone with a voice this incredible absolutely had to be good-looking too!","As for Qing... 81 points was barely passing, and his rebate was only one-to-one.","Even a tiny mosquito was still meat.","Besides, Qing was the only one who had taken the initiative to contact her.","In the past, she hadn’t had any money and could only sit in the audience, watching other people lavish fortunes on handsome men.","But now...","Gu Lan’s thoughts went around in countless twists and turns, and a mischievous smile slowly curled across her lips.","Times had changed. Now that she had money, it was finally the handsome men’s turn to fawn over her.","She leisurely typed a reply to Qing.","[Food Liu You: This is my first time using this, so I don’t really understand (。•『•。).]","Playing dumb was a woman’s innate talent.","After sending the message, she asked the system again, “San-chan, I can’t actually be spending my own money, can I?”","The system’s cheerful voice immediately rang out:","[The unlimited black card has been credited! The card number has been automatically saved to your mobile wallet. Please bind it and recharge as needed!]","Gu Lan immediately exited the app. Sure enough, she found a black card she had never seen before in her mobile wallet. There was no bank logo on it—only a string of numbers shimmering with rainbow-colored light.","She skillfully copied the card number, returned to the Oxygen app’s recharge page, selected the highest amount, pasted in the number, and entered the password.","[Recharge successful! Your account has received 1,000,000 diamonds. (Exchange rate: 1 diamond = 0.01 yuan.)]","Ten thousand yuan in exchange for one million diamonds.","Looking at that long string of zeroes, Gu Lan nodded in satisfaction.","She’d test the waters first.","When she returned to the “Goodnight Melody” room, a round of mic rotations had just ended.","That clear, mellow male voice she couldn’t stop thinking about rang out once more.","“All right, the mic rotation is over. Sisters lurking in the background, does anyone else want to request a song?”","It was him! It was Xu!","Gu Lan’s heartbeat skipped, and she hurriedly typed in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: How do I request a song? (confused).jpg]","Xu’s voice carried a smile as he was about to explain. “To request a song, just find the—”","Before he could finish, a dazzling gift animation suddenly exploded across the screen.","A gigantic pink “Love Confession Balloon” slowly rose into view, taking up half the screen.","[Strawberry Cheesecake sent Wn.Muzhi a Love Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds = 520 yuan)]","Immediately afterward, another somewhat urgent male voice forced its way in, cutting Xu off.","“Thanks for the Love Confession Balloon, Sis Cheesecake! Mwah! You’re spoiling me, Sis! Sorry, Brother Xu, I’m going to sing a song for my sis first.”","It was the one called Muzhi.","Gu Lan stared at the public chat. After being interrupted, Xu didn’t say anything else, and the entire public mic was soon taken over by Muzhi and Strawberry Cheesecake’s interaction.","Gu Lan pouted.","So this was what cutting in line looked like.","A wealthy older sister really was something else.","She wasn’t angry, though. Instead, she cheerfully continued typing in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: Wow, so lucky! I get to listen for free.]","She put on an innocent, clueless act.","Just then, another private message lit up.","It was from Xu.","[Wn.Xu: Find the “Request a Song” gift worth 3,320 diamonds in the gift list, choose the host you want to request it from, and send it. That’s all.]","He had even attached a screenshot of the gift list, with the “Request a Song” gift clearly circled.","Oh, he was pretty considerate.","Gu Lan’s impression of Xu improved a little more.","[Food Liu You: Got it! Thank you!]","[Food Liu You: (Thank you).jpg]","She returned to the room. Muzhi had already started singing.","Gu ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍Lan patiently listened for two lines.","How should she put it? He had some technical skill, but his singing felt greasy. Every vocal flourish carried the deliberate air of someone saying, “Hurry up and praise how handsome I am.”","Compared with Xu’s clear, natural voice, it was practically a public execution.","Gu Lan, who was used to hearing divine-level singers on Douyin, really couldn’t bear to listen any longer.","She exited the room without hesitation.","She’d come back after this Muzhi finished singing.","She had no interest in wasting her time on singing of this caliber.","At the same time Gu Lan left the room, a new message appeared in a WeChat group called “Goodnight Melody Lineup.”","[Wn.Xu: @Wn.Muzhi, next time, wait until I’ve finished explaining how to request a song before interrupting.]","The group fell silent for a few seconds.","Then someone named Wn.Yechen jumped in.","[Wn.Yechen: Oh, come on, Brother Xu, don’t be mad. Brother Muzhi was only thinking about the room’s revenue. Look, Sis Cheesecake even sent gifts.]","Yechen sent another message.","[Wn.Yechen: That Food Liu You person is a level-zero account. Who knows whether she’ll actually spend anything? It’s more important to take care of big spenders like Sis Cheesecake.]","[Wn.Muzhi: Sis Cheesecake never cut in line when she used to watch Brother Xu. I spoiled her too much. Sorry.]","[Wn.Ears: Oho, showing off now, are we?]"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: I heard you can cut in line if you have money Then let me casually cut in line","paragraphs":["Gu Lan was idly browsing the Oxygen app.","She clicked into several of the most popular voice rooms and listened to a few so-called “heavenly voices,” only to be sorely disappointed.","Some had such heavy voice effects that they sounded obviously fake. Others were oily and affected, twisting every word into eighteen different flourishes.","Not one of them could compare to Xu.","That man’s voice was like mint soda chilled in the height of summer—crisp, clean, with a faint, barely perceptible laziness in its bubbles.","Just listening to him was soothing.","After wandering around for a while, Gu Lan failed to find any suitable substitute and could only slink back to the “Goodnight Melody” room.","The moment she entered, she heard a commotion on the microphones.","Muzhi had already finished singing and was chatting animatedly with the woman nicknamed Strawberry Cheesecake.","“Cheesecake Sis, the avatar frame and chat bubble you’re using today are so pretty!”","“Of course they are. My Cheesecake Sis looks good in everything!” a man’s ingratiating voice immediately chimed in. It belonged to Yechen.","Gu Lan listened for a moment, feeling rather bored.","She wanted to hear Xu speak.","But aside from those two, all the other hosts connected to the microphones were sitting in complete silence, as if they had turned invisible.","Just as she was about to leave the room running while she scrolled through short videos, two messages suddenly appeared on the public chat.","[Wn.Xu: @Food Liu You, welcome back.]","[Wn.Qing: @Food Liu You, welcome back, Sis.]","Gu Lan froze.","They... remembered her?","She was only a level-zero alt account, and she had just left the room without saying a word.","She looked at the two names on the public chat. One was refined and clear, the other youthful and fresh. For some reason, she found them exceptionally pleasing to the eye.","Then she glanced at Muzhi, who was still chattering away and fawning over the older woman on the microphone. A mischievous idea suddenly popped into Gu Lan’s head.","She leisurely opened her gift inventory.","The diamonds she had just purchased were still gleaming.","She found the “Confession Balloon,” a gift worth 52,000 diamonds.","Then, without hurry, she selected two recipients at once: Wn.Xu and Wn.Qing.","Confirm. Send.","The next second—","“...and I’m telling you, Cheesecake Sis, she...”","Muzhi’s voice cut off abruptly on the microphone.","It was as though someone had strangled him.","The entire screen was swallowed by two enormous special effects exploding one after another.","Magnificent pink balloons carrying hearts slowly rose into the air. The animation was exquisite yet domineering, taking up everyone’s field of vision.","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Xu a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Qing a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","The public chat fell into deathly silence for a moment before exploding.","[Wn.Ears: !!! Holy crap! Thank you, my Food Liu You Sis, for sending Confession Balloons to Brother Xu and Qing! What a generous boss! May you make a fortune!]","[Wn.Volcano: Thank you, Sis, for supporting Xu and Qing! Sis, you’re incredible!]","[Wn.Yechen: Thank you, Sis...]","The hosts connected to the microphones seemed to have been switched on by some invisible button. One after another, they began thanking her, each speaking faster than the last, afraid of falling behind by even half a second.","As for the newcomer named Qing, this was the first time he had received such a huge gift. His voice was trembling.","“Th-thank you... Thank you, Food Liu You Sis, for the Confession Balloon... I, I...” He repeated “I” for a long while, too excited to get a coherent sentence out.","The little fans in the public chat went even crazier.","[Squid Strips: Aaaaaaaaaah! Our Xu finally has a big spender! Is this real?! Am I dreaming?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Exactly! Two 520 gifts! That’s over a thousand yuan! Sis, are you still looking for a leg ornament?]","[Little Wimp: What kind of goddess is this? She comes in and blows up the screen right away!]","Amid the chaos and astonishment, Gu Lan leisurely typed a message into the public chat, adding an innocent-looking sticker at the end.","[Food Liu You: So, does this mean I get to cut in line now? (confused).jpg]","The moment the message appeared, the noisy chorus of thanks from the microphones came to an abrupt halt again.","Everyone caught the unmistakable sarcasm in her words.","Wasn’t she copying what Muzhi had just done—using a gift to forcibly interrupt someone else?","And doing it right in front of everyone, slapping him squarely in the face.","Muzhi’s microphone remained lit, but he did not make another sound.","Gu Lan could practically imagine how ugly his expression must be.","She was in an excellent mood.","That felt much better.","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 90-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Xu,” triggering a 1:10 cashback reward. A cashback of 5,200 yuan has been credited!]","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 81-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Qing,” triggering a 1:1 cashback reward. A cashback of 520 yuan has been credited!]","The system’s notification rang out in her mind, making the curve of Gu Lan’s lips grow even wider.","She had spent a thousand yuan and earned more than five thousand back.","Not bad at all.","In the public chat, some confused fans were still marveling.","[Four-Leaf Clover: Huh? Is it popular to request songs with 520-yuan gifts now? I feel bad spending even fifty-two yuan on a request.]","[One Punch Will Crush You: You didn’t get it, did you? Sis is teaching certain people how things are done!]","At that moment, the clear, soothing voice she had been longing to hear finally rang out, breaking the awkward silence with a hint of helpless amusement.","“Ahem, that’s enough. Thank you, Sis.”","Xu paused, seemingly organizing his thoughts.","“So, I’m more familiar with sad love songs, while Qing is new here, but he’s pretty good at singing pop songs.”","His voice was unhurried and steady, instantly guiding the atmosphere in the room back onto the right track.","Then he turned to the newcomer who was still stammering and said, “Qing, send your song list to... Food... Liu You Sis.”","When he said “Food Liu You,” Xu ultimately couldn’t hold back. A very soft laugh escaped through the microphone.","It was faint, but Gu Lan still heard it.","She immediately pounced on him in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: I heard that! You’re laughing at my name! (sobbing).jpg]","[Food Liu You: That’s too much! You’re being punished with one extra song!]","The fans in the public chat joined in the teasing.","[Squid Strips: Hahaha, that’s right! How could you laugh at our big sis, Brother Xu?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Punish him! He absolutely has to sing!]","Xu let out a low laugh. The sound traveled through the current and slipped into Gu Lan’s ears, making her toes curl.","“My fault, my fault. I couldn’t help myself.” His voice was full of laughter. “Then... thank you, Miss Liu You?”","Gu Lan continued typing.","[Food Liu You: Listen to yourself. “Liu You”—does that sound nice to you? Can a girl really be called that?]","Xu readily went along with her. “Then... thank you, Lazy Lamb?”","Gu Lan’s avatar was an abstract-looking Lazy Lamb, so he had clearly noticed it.","That nickname...","Somehow, it sounded even cuter.","Gu Lan’s heart filled with delight. She was just about to reply when the host named Ears suddenly cut in, speaking at lightning speed.","“Hey! Sis, sis! We have a rule in our room— for 300 yuan, you can reserve a private claim! Want to reserve one?”","A private claim?","Gu Lan genuinely had no idea what that slang meant.","【Food Liu You: Private claim? What’s that?】","Ears immediately explained, “Once you reserve a private claim, no one in our room besides Xu and Qing, whom you requested, is allowed to proactively ‘assign you homework’ or send you private messages for no reason! Anyone caught doing it gets fined!”","“Assigning homework” was their slang for privately messaging someone to poach them.","The moment Ears said that, his intentions became glaringly obvious.","He was doing this to guard against Muzhi.","After all, Strawberry Cheesecake had originally come to listen to Xu as well. But because she hadn’t reserved a private claim, Muzhi had coaxed her away with a few private messages.","It was a cautionary tale.","With this move, Ears had dragged Muzhi’s little scheme straight into the open, making it impossible for him to use the same trick again.","Gu Lan understood instantly.","Oh? So that was how this worked?","Interesting.","Instead of answering directly, she deliberately tagged Xu in the public chat.","【Food Liu You: @Wn.Xu I don’t understand. Should I reserve one?】","She ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍tossed the ball to Xu.","The moment she asked, Xu’s fans in the public chat became more anxious than anyone else.","【Squid Strips: @Food Liu You Sis, reserve one, reserve one! Please!】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Reserve it, reserve it, reserve it! We all did! Once you reserve one, we’ll be family!】","They were terrified that this goddess-like big sis who had appeared out of nowhere would be lured away by that greasy guy from next door.","There was silence on the mic for a few seconds.","Everyone’s attention focused on Xu.","Then he let out a soft laugh, and a hint of seriousness entered his clear, warm voice.","“Of course I hope you will.”","His answer was direct and frank.","Gu Lan was very pleased.","She liked people who didn’t beat around the bush.","【Food Liu You: Okay then, I’ll reserve one.】","She sent another message.","【Food Liu You: You guys can choose the songs yourselves. I’ll listen to whatever you’re best at.】"]}]);
